		"description": "<p>The most common form of military plasma weapon, these guns propel bolts of highenergy plasma. The weapon has a relatively high rate of fire, able to produce several bolts in quick succession, but their effective range is limited. These weapons were used for destroying armored targets such as combat mechs and vehicles.</p><p>The profile for the Plasma Repeater can be found in the Military Weapons Table at the start of this section. A Plasma Repeater is a powered weapon, which recharges after a Bed rest.</p>",
